this project is combined with ABA Developer ESP32 RTOS template 

all codes is written in apps/your-apps
every your-apps folder contains config, kernel, registry, transport, and utils
for example:
    apps/Motor
    apps/Encoder
    apps/TCPHandler
    apps/PID

    apps/Motor             apps/Encoder            apps/etc.
        - config               - config                - config
        - kernel               - kernel                - kernel
        - registry             - registry              - registry
        - transport            - transport             - transport
        - utils                - utils                 - utils

nothing to do in main.cpp
setup() are written in app.cpp
